<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QNI sees profit improved in 2nd half.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QNI sees profit improved in 2nd half.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nickel and cobalt miner QNI Ltd said on Tuesday that if the improving trend in metal prices seen since the start of 1997 continued, the company would see an improvement in profit in the second half of the 1996/97 year (July-June).</p>
</text>
